task(DOCS-RECONCILE-WORKTREE-GUARD):   // P3
  title    = "docs_reconcile must refuse to WRITE INDEX from a git worktree (it truncates it)"
  status   = done  // 2026-07-03-ds: _in_worktree() in docs_reconcile.py + skip() in git_pre_commit.sh (aa16d86)
  priority = media
  date     = "2026-07-02"
  owner    = "DS [S]"
  context:
    "Run from a worktree, docs_reconcile.py --update counts only materialized files (gitignored
     experiments/sessions/corpus absent) → regenerates docs/INDEX.md truncated (seen 675→614). The
     shared pre-commit hook then git-adds it, so a worktree commit can stage a corrupted index."
  design:
    "(1) docs_reconcile.py: detect a linked worktree (git rev-parse --git-dir != --git-common-dir)
         and ABORT any INDEX/.index.db WRITE with a clear message; read-only CHECK may still run.
     (2) scripts/docs/git_pre_commit.sh: if in a worktree, SKIP reconcile + 'git add INDEX.md'.
     Belt-and-suspenders. See memory feedback_docs_index (worktree caveat)."
  files    = [scripts/docs/docs_reconcile.py, scripts/docs/git_pre_commit.sh]


task(DEPLOY-SSH-RETRY-HARDEN):   // P4
  title    = "deploy scripts must retry SSH verification through the n01 bastion (SPOF flap)"
  status   = done  // 2026-07-03-ds: setup_ssh_controlmaster() + retry_with_backoff() in deploy_bundle.sh (aa16d86)
  priority = media
  date     = "2026-07-02"
  owner    = "DS [S]"
  context:
    "During the OMEGA deploy the n01 bastion flapped ('Connection timed out during banner
     exchange'); the cutover landed but verification steps silently returned empty until a manual
     retry. n01 is the sole ProxyJump to n02 (R8) — transient flaps are expected, not exceptional."
  design:
    "(1) ssh config: ControlMaster auto + ControlPersist 60s for n02 (reuse one channel through
         n01 → fewer bastion handshakes).
     (2) deploy_bundle.sh + ad-hoc deploys: wrap each idempotent VERIFY ssh call in a 3x retry with
         backoff; a verify that returns empty/nonzero must RETRY, never silently pass.
     (3) keep the cutover (stop→verify-pid→mv→start) as the single atomic remote cmd it already is."
  files    = [scripts/deploy_bundle.sh, "~/.ssh/config (n02 ControlMaster/Persist)"]


