    "Root lesson of CASE-TRIAGE-CONFAB (105 sev-10 auto-closed with a false
     narrative; guard vacuous: LIKE '%\"event #%' matches every record). Change
     the Decision contract in vsf_s5_agent.py: a 'handle' decision MUST attach
     evidence = [(question, query_executed, observed_result, pass/fail)]; the
     review loop rejects narrative-only closures structurally. Canonical rewrite
     of _clf_merkle_break_early: (a) restart within ±5min of finding ts (vs
     state.db services.active_since), (b) offending system_id is a declared
     writer, (c) zero high-index breaks in window (LIKE bug fixed). Elevate to
     hard rule R12 in state.db rules + RULES.md mirror: 'Automated triage may
     close an algedonic signal only by attaching machine-checkable evidence;
